agna, et encore moins de prendre racine à cet endroit !"],""],[16775,"cagnotte","noun",2,"/ka.ɲɔt/","f",[13431,"Fr-cagnotte.ogg.mp3"],[["pool, pot (of money, for distribution)","صندوق پول، اندوخته مشترک",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cagnottes"},[],["Qui m'a trahi? dit Collin...\"c'est toi, lui dit-il, vieille cagnotte\""],""],[20367,"cagneux","adjective",2,"/ka.ɲø/","",[16335,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-cagneux.wav.mp3"],[["knock-kneed (having the knees abnormally close together)","زانوبه‌هم‌چسبیده",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"cagneux","feminine":"cagneuse","masculine_plural":"cagneux","feminine_plural":"cagneuses"},[],["Ce cheval est cagneux mais il a bon caractère.","Le convoqué entra, voûté, cagneux, puant le bouc.","Une taille déjetée, des épaules voûtées et des jambes cagneuses complétaient ce disgracieux ensemble."],""],[22295,"caguer","verb",1,"/ka.ɡe/","",[17950,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-caguer.wav.mp3"],[["to defecate","مدفوع کردن",["informal"],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"caguer","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"caguant","past_participle":"cagué","present":["cague","cagues","cague","caguons","caguez","caguent"],"imperfect":["caguais","caguais","caguait","caguions","caguiez","caguaient"],"future":["caguerai","cagueras","caguera","caguerons","caguerez","cagueront"],"conditional":["caguerais","caguerais","caguerait","caguerions","cagueriez","cagueraient"],"subjunctive":["cague","cagues","cague","caguions","caguiez","caguent"]},[],["ils nous font caguer","Excuse-moi, Goï, tout à l'heure, j'ai cagué, je ne sais pas ce qui m'a pris...","L'image grossière qui consiste à envoyer caguer au loin un importun permet évidemment d'exprimer davantage de mépris."],""],[25018,"cagette","noun",1,"","f","",[["carton, (small) crate (or similar packaging)","جعبهٔ مقوایی، صندوقچهٔ کوچک",[],[],[]],["punnet","ظرف کوچک میوه",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cagettes"},[],["On les voyait rentrer à midi une cagette de poireaux ou de carottes sous le bras, un peu d'argent en poche.","Les fromages sont ressuyés de deux ou trois jours et affinés une dizaine de jours avant la mise en marché, en cagette de bois.","Dans la remise, le père monta au grenier et cacha le squelette derrière une pile de cagettes vides qu'il tenait en réserve pour en faire du bois d'allumage."],"",[["cage","noun"],["cagette","noun"]]],[25138,"cagoulard","noun",1,"/ka.ɡu.laʁ/","m","",[["cagoulard","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cagoulards","feminine":"cagoularde"},[],["Après le 18 janvier, le successeur d'Auriol, le radical César Campinchi, instaura les bontés pour les cagoulards emprisonnés."],""],[25426,"cagoulé","adjective",1,"/ka.ɡu.le/","",[20564,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-cagoul%C3%A9.wav.mp3"],[["masked by a balaclava","بالاکلاواپوش، نقاب‌دار",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"cagoulé","feminine":"cagoulée","masculine_plural":"cagoulés","feminine_plural":"cagoulées"},[],"","",[["cagoule","noun"],["cagouler","verb"],["cagoulé","adjective"]]],[26175,"cagnard","adjective",1,"/ka.ɲaʁ/","",[21196,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-cagnard.wav.mp3"],[["cowardly","ترسو، بزدل",[],[],[]],["lazy","تنبل، کاهل",[],["paresseux"],[]]],{"masculine":"cagnard","feminine":"cagnarde","masculine_plural":"cagnards","feminine_plural":"cagnardes"},[],"",""],[26176,"cagnard","noun",1,"/ka.ɲaʁ/","m",[21196,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-cagnard.wav.mp3"],[["coward","ترسو، بزدل",[],[],[]],["lazy person","آدم تنبل، تن‌پرور",[],["tire-au-flanc","paresseux"],[]],["suntrap (warm place that captures the heat of the sun)","جای آفتاب‌گیر و گرم",[],[],[["Tu as laissé la voiture en plein cagnard, ça va être un four là-dedans","",""]]],["extreme heat","گرمای شدید، سوز گرما",[],[],[["C'est le cagnard ici.","",""]]]],{"plural":"cagnards","feminine":"cagnarde"},[],"","",[["cagnarder","verb"],["cagnard","noun"]]],[26651,"cagot","adjective",1,"/ka.ɡo/","",[21581,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Ltrlg-cagot.wav.mp3"],[["sanctimonious","ریاکارانه، زاهدنمایانه",["dated"],[],[]]],{"masculine":"cagot","feminine":"cagote","masculine_plural":"cagots","feminine_pl